# SPA fallback for client-side routing.
#
# RoktoNet uses react-router's BrowserRouter, so a URL like
# /hospital/requests/42 exists only inside the JavaScript bundle -- there
# is no such file in dist/. Without this rule, Cloudflare Pages looks for
# that file, doesn't find it, and returns its own 404 page. That breaks
# every page refresh and every directly-pasted deep link, while normal
# in-app navigation still works -- which is exactly what makes it easy to
# miss during testing.
#
# This serves index.html for any unmatched path with a 200 (not a
# redirect), letting react-router read the URL and render the right route.
# Real files in dist/ (the JS/CSS assets) still win over this rule.
/*    /index.html   200
